# Vanguard Seraph: "Whenever you gain life for the first time each turn, surveil 1" (CR 603.2, 701.25a). On turn 1 Bot1 casts the
# Seraph (a 3/3 flier) and gains 3 life with Healing Salve: the first gain surveils, and Bot1 puts the top card, Lightning Bolt,
# into the graveyard. A second Salve the same turn gains life again and surveils nothing (the stack is empty, and the next card,
# a third Healing Salve, stays on top). On turn 3 Bot1 draws that Salve and gains life again: a new turn, a new first gain, so it
# surveils again and this time keeps the top Island.

